# BASE-07 2026-10-18: one-off scratch probe litter (drift<N>.txt /
# pass<N>.txt, contents = own index) from an Oct-16 scratch loop; producer
# not live anywhere. Ignored so dirty-tree ship gates stay meaningful; safe
# to delete the files outright.
drift*.txt
pass*.txt
sub*.txt

